        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Reference\n\n```\nIDF  : txt2img-basic-fx10-sdvq\nIDI  : T2I-BAS_FX10_SDVQ\nT2I  : Text to image\nFX10 : Flux.1\nSVDQ : Singular Value Decomposition Quantization\nCDL  : Clip Dual\n```\n\n# Models\n\n## Diffusion Models (SVDQ)\n\n📂 models / diffusion_models\n\nflux.1 dev\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-dev/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-dev.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-dev/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-dev.safetensors (50-series)\n\nflux.1 schnell\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-schnell/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-schnell.safetensors?download=true) svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-schnell.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-schnell/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-schnell.safetensors?download=true) svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-schnell.safetensors (50-series)\n\nflux.1 kontext\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-kontext-dev/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-kontext-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-kontext-dev.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/mit-han-lab/nunchaku-flux.1-kontext-dev/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-kontext-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-kontext-dev.safetensors (50-series)\n\nflux.1 krea\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-flux.1-krea-dev/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-krea-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-krea-dev.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-flux.1-krea-dev/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-krea-dev.safetensors?download=true) svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-krea-dev.safetensors (50-series)\n\nflux.1 dev colossus\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-flux.1-dev-colossus/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-dev-colossusv12.safetensors?download=true) svdq-int4_r32-flux.1-dev-colossusv12.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-tech/nunchaku-flux.1-dev-colossus/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-dev-colossusv12.safetensors?download=true) svdq-fp4_r32-flux.1-dev-colossusv12.safetensors (pre-50-series)\n\n## Dual Clip Loader (GGUF) \n\n📂 models / text_encoders\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/resolve/main/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf?download=true) t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf [other versions](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/tree/main) \n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/clip_l.safetensors?download=true)  clip_l.safetensor\n\n## VAE\n\n📂 models / vae\n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Lumina_Image_2.0_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors?download=true) ae.safetensor\n\n## Upscale Model\n\n📂 models / upscale_models  \n\n- [⬇️](https://huggingface.co/Akumetsu971/SD_Anime_Futuristic_Armor/resolve/main/4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth?download=true) 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth \n\n✳️​\n\n# Custom Nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI rgthree](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)\n- [ComfyUI Easy Use](https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use)\n- [ComfyUI Custom Scripts](https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts)\n- [ComfyUI TiledDiffusion](https://github.com/shiimizu/ComfyUI-TiledDiffusion)\n- [ComfyUI Image Size Tools](https://github.com/TheLustriVA/ComfyUI-Image-Size-Tools)\n- [ComfyUI GGUF](https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF)\n- [ComfyUI TeaCache](https://github.com/welltop-cn/ComfyUI-TeaCache)\n\n# Resources\n- [Github](https://github.com/yaiol/ComfyUI-Workflows)\n- [SVDQuant: Absorbing Outliers by Low-Rank Components for 4-Bit Diffusion Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.05007)\n\n\n\n\n"
